== Usage ==

Potato flowers can be planted in a [[flower pot]].

=== Bees ===
[[Bee]]s engage in a pollinating behavior with potato flowers, increasing the honey level in [[beehive]]s and [[bee nest]]s by 1. These flowers can also be used to [[breed]], grow, and lead bees.

=== Suspicious stew ===
A potato flower can be used for crafting a [[suspicious stew]], which gives the [[Poison]] effect to the player for 12 seconds after eating it.

